flowchart LR
    A[Use]
    B[Processing]
    C[Integration]
    D[Consumption]
    E[Archival]

    A --> B --> C --> D --> E

    A --> A1["Risk:<br/>PII exposure"]
    A1 --> A2["Mitigation:<br/>• Enforce strict IAM<br/>• Multifactor Authentication (MFA)<br/>• Encrypt data at rest"]

    B --> B1["Risk:<br/>Format incompatibility<br/>or data corruption during ETL"]
    B1 --> B2["Mitigation:<br/>• Strict schema validation<br/>• Automated data quality checks"]

    C --> C1["Risk:<br/>Data silos create fragmented user views across Google services"]
    C1 --> C2["Mitigation:<br/>• Centralized data lake/warehouse<br/>• Unified naming conventions<br/>• Consistent primary keys"]

    D --> D1["Risk:<br/>Creators misinterpret analytics due to loss of context"]
    D1 --> D2["Mitigation:<br/>• Data dictionaries<br/>• Tooltips<br/>• Educational resources in YouTube Studio"]

    E --> E1["Risk:<br/>Retaining user data longer than legally permitted"]
    E1 --> E2["Mitigation:<br/>• Automated lifecycle management<br/>• Automatic purge or anonymization after retention period"]

